From b1dfde3948bc1e2bfeb1dd626d3587de483cb965 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: u <u@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:07:02 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: krnl386, vm86, libwine, otvdm build

- relay: on ARM64 call the typed convspec relay function of the entry
  point; thunks built at run time use relay_call_from_16 as relay and
  get their arguments from the CALLFROM16 argument types (64-bit
  pointers, sign extended LONG).  call_entry_point is plain C.
- ne_module: add the image base to the image relative addresses that
  convspec stores in the 16-bit code segment.
- Accessors for STACK16FRAME.frame32 and the TDB event handle.
- Fix pointer/integer mixups found by the 64-bit build.
- Disable the i386 only DPMI real mode callback assembly.
- convspec: export __wine_spec_dos_header without decoration on ARM64.
- wine_common_ver.rc: llvm-rc does not join adjacent strings.
